IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dpc-rules`

-- Defence (Parliamentary Candidates) Act 1969 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`officer` MEANS `an officer of the Permanent Navy, Regular Army or Permanent Air Force`
`enlisted` MEANS `an enlisted member of the Permanent Navy, Regular Army or Permanent Air Force`
`reservist` MEANS `a Reserve member on continuous full-time service`

GIVEN s IS A `My service`, app IS A MAYBE DATE, notice IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Candidate case`
`a` s `applying` app `noticed` notice MEANS
    `Candidate case` OF s, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (Date 31 3 2025), FALSE, app, FALSE, notice, FALSE, 3000

-- ss 7-9
#ASSERT `my route for` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS `transfer to the appropriate Reserve (s 7)`
#ASSERT `my route for` (`a` `enlisted` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS `discharge (s 8)`
#ASSERT `my route for` (`a` `reservist` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS `termination of continuous full-time service (s 9)`
#ASSERT `my route for` (`Candidate case` OF `officer`, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, 0) EQUALS `no route under this Act`
-- declared 31 March 2025: apply by 31 May 2025.
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 5 2025)
#ASSERT `is my application in time for` (`a` `officer` `applying` (JUST (Date 31 5 2025)) `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is my application in time for` (`a` `officer` `applying` (JUST (Date 1 6 2025)) `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is my application in time for` (`Candidate case` OF `officer`, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (Date 31 3 2025), FALSE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- ss 13-14: notice by 30 April 2025 (no 31 April).
#ASSERT `the last notice day for` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 4 2025)
#ASSERT `the deemed application day for` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` (JUST (Date 30 4 2025))) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 5 2025)
#ASSERT `the deemed application day for` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` (JUST (Date 1 5 2025))) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`I am deemed re-enlisted` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` (JUST (Date 30 4 2025))))
#ASSERT `I am deemed re-enlisted` (`a` `enlisted` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` (JUST (Date 30 4 2025)))
-- s 9 members: no compulsory reinstatement
#ASSERT `the last notice day for` (`a` `reservist` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- elected: no compulsory reinstatement
#ASSERT `the last notice day for` (`Candidate case` OF `officer`, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (Date 31 3 2025), TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, 0) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 17
#ASSERT `the repayment for` (`a` `enlisted` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` (JUST (Date 30 4 2025))) EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the repayment for` (`a` `officer` `applying` NOTHING `noticed` (JUST (Date 30 4 2025))) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the repayment for` (`Candidate case` OF `officer`, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (Date 31 3 2025), FALSE, JUST (Date 1 5 2025), FALSE, NOTHING, TRUE, 3000) EQUALS 3000
